{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.639999389648438,"text":"It looks like green stones. It is the remains of a 2,000-year-old machine packed with bronze gear wheels and sharp little teeth. You turned a handle, and pointers showed where the sun and moon were, when the light would go out in an eclipse, even which year the games fell in. It is the oldest known geared machine in the world, and nothing as complicated was built again for about a thousand years afterwards.","words":[{"word":"It","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"looks","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":0.800000011920929},{"word":"like","start":0.800000011920929,"end":1.2000000476837158},{"word":"green","start":1.2000000476837158,"end":1.7000000476837158},{"word":"stones","start":1.7000000476837158,"end":2.140000104904175},{"word":"It","start":2.819999933242798,"end":2.880000114440918},{"word":"is","start":2.880000114440918,"end":3.059999942779541},{"word":"the","start":3.059999942779541,"end":3.3399999141693115},{"word":"remains","start":3.3399999141693115,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"of","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":3.940000057220459},{"word":"a","start":3.940000057220459,"end":4.239999771118164},{"word":"2","start":4.239999771118164,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"000","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.880000114440918},{"word":"year","start":4.880000114440918,"end":5.159999847412109},{"word":"old","start":5.159999847412109,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"machine","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"packed","start":5.900000095367432,"end":6.5},{"word":"with","start":6.5,"end":7.099999904632568},{"word":"bronze","start":7.099999904632568,"end":7.099999904632568},{"word":"gear","start":7.099999904632568,"end":7.400000095367432},{"word":"wheels","start":7.400000095367432,"end":7.639999866485596},{"word":"and","start":7.639999866485596,"end":8.039999961853027},{"word":"sharp","start":8.039999961853027,"end":8.260000228881836},{"word":"little"